WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.199
Warga sini minta
jalannya ditambal.

2
00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:03.528
Yang datang
malah panggung.

3
00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:06.239
Selamat datang di
Republik WKWKWK.

4
00:00:06.273 --> 00:00:07.221
Hari pertama…

5
00:00:07.297 --> 00:00:08.814
kita mau
meresmikan jalan.

6
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:10.337
Jalannya belum jadi.

7
00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.391
Nah, Pak Bahlil datang.

8
00:00:12.391 --> 00:00:13.979
Warga langsung
kumpul.

9
00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:15.633
Kirain mau dicek
lubangnya…

10
00:00:15.907 --> 00:00:17.684
…ternyata mau
dipotong pitanya.

11
00:00:17.988 --> 00:00:18.936
Diindaa!

12
00:00:19.012 --> 00:00:20.440
Yang penting
kita mulai dulu!

13
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.146
Mulai nambalnya kapan?

14
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.912
Pertanyaan bagus.

15
00:00:23.945 --> 00:00:25.054
Sayangnya…

16
00:00:25.054 --> 00:00:26.742
nggak ada di
susunan acara.

17
00:00:27.052 --> 00:00:29.758
Sebelum difoto,
semua disuruh geser.

18
00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:31.110
Bukan supaya muat…

19
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.371
…supaya lubangnya
nggak kelihatan.

20
00:00:34.031 --> 00:00:35.092
Keprok atuh!

21
00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.360
Eh… ini jalan
masih rusak.

22
00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:38.434
Betul apa tidak?

23
00:00:38.944 --> 00:00:40.062
Acara selesai.

24
00:00:40.096 --> 00:00:41.385
Foto sudah bagus.

25
00:00:41.461 --> 00:00:42.395
Tinggal pulang.

26
00:00:43.192 --> 00:00:45.691
Oh. Lubangnya
belum ikut selesai.

27
00:00:46.451 --> 00:00:48.328
Nah! Sekarang baru
turun langsung!

28
00:00:48.328 --> 00:00:49.200
Keprok atuh!

29
00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.541
Tadi warga yang
disuruh sabar.

30
00:00:51.605 --> 00:00:53.520
Sekarang beliau
yang disuruh dorong.

31
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:55.686
Di tempatmu, yang
duluan datang

32
00:00:55.686 --> 00:00:56.976
aspal atau spanduk?

33
00:00:57.009 --> 00:00:58.424
Cerita di komentar.

